WEBVTT

NOTE
End of Disc 1. Squall, mortally wounded by Edea's ice lance, falls from the parade float into Deling City below. The scene features slow-motion footage of his falling body, flashes of Rinoa reaching out, and the descent into unconsciousness. A dramatic cliffhanger ending for the first disc. Duration: approximately 41 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Squall staggers backward on the parade float, the ice lance still protruding through his body. His eyes flutter weakly. His breathing becomes shallow and labored. He is at the very edge of the float's platform, teetering on the precipice.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Squall falls backward off the float. The city of Deling City sprawls below, a tapestry of lights and buildings beneath him. His body tumbles through the air in slow motion, arms outstretched, fingers grasping at the empty night sky. His white shirt flutters around him, stained deeply with blood.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The camera follows Squall's descending body, rotating to show the city lights and night sky spinning wildly above him. His conscious mind is fading. His eyes are glazed and unfocused. The ice lance trails behind him as he falls, a grotesque reminder of the magical force that defeated him.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
A flash of Rinoa's face appears, her expression filled with desperation and horror. Her hand reaches out toward Squall, trying to grab him, to save him from his fall. Her eyes are wide with anguish. Her lips move silently. The image is vivid but brief, a fragmented memory or vision.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Squall continues falling, the city buildings and lights becoming more defined as he drops lower. His body is limp and helpless. The world spins around him. Consciousness is slipping away rapidly. His vision begins to blur at the edges.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Another flash: Rinoa's anguished face, closer now, tears streaming down her cheeks. Her hand is extended toward Squall desperately. Her mouth opens as if to call his name. The flash is brief, soon replaced by the image of the falling soldier.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The street below is rapidly approaching. The city lights form halos in Squall's failing vision. His body is still falling in slow motion, but the ground is clearly getting closer. His consciousness is fragmenting. His breathing has become barely perceptible.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Squall's eyes close. The world becomes dark and blurred. His fall continues, but he is no longer fully aware. Only sounds reach him now: the whistle of wind, the echo of the city, the fading memory of Rinoa's desperate face.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
The final moments of consciousness: Squall's body hits the hard pavement of Deling City's streets below. The impact is sudden and violent. His body collapses onto the stone surface. The ice lance lies beside him, still gleaming with magical energy.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Squall lies motionless on the ground. His eyes are closed. His breathing is shallow and labored. Blood stains his white shirt and the pavement around him. The city lights create long shadows across his prone form. Consciousness has fled entirely.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Fade to black. The screen goes completely dark. The sound fades to silence. Disc 1 has ended. The narrative will continue on Disc 2.
